    "body": "Didn't realise you wanted a response.\n\n#2204 is unrelated.\n\nOther libraries such as tensorflow-gpu have put effort into ensuring results match the cpu implementions (e.g. convolving with tensorflow or tensorflow-gpu or numpy produces the same values, even including precision errors)",
